%% Sequence Diagram for Youth Account Management APIs
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent
    participant WebUI as Web/Mobile UI
    participant APIGW as API Gateway
    participant YouthAPI as Youth Service
    participant Settings as Settings Service
    participant TxnProxy as Transaction Service Proxy
    participant CoreBank as Core Banking
    participant Auth as OAuth Service

    Parent->>WebUI: Login & Access Dashboard
    WebUI->>APIGW: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard (OAuth2)
    APIGW->>Auth: Validate OAuth2 Token
    Auth-->>APIGW: Token Valid
    APIGW->>YouthAPI: getDashboard(youthAccountId)
    YouthAPI->>CoreBank: Get Account Balance
    YouthAPI->>Settings: Get Spending Limit
    YouthAPI->>TxnProxy: Get Recent Transactions
    TxnProxy->>CoreBank: Fetch Transactions
    CoreBank-->>TxnProxy: Transaction List
    TxnProxy-->>YouthAPI: Transaction Data
    CoreBank-->>YouthAPI: Account Balance
    Settings-->>YouthAPI: Spending Limit
    YouthAPI-->>APIGW: Dashboard Payload
    APIGW-->>WebUI: Dashboard JSON
    WebUI-->>Parent: Render Dashboard

    Parent->>WebUI: Initiate Fund Transfer
    WebUI->>APIGW: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer
    APIGW->>Auth: Validate OAuth2 Token
    Auth-->>APIGW: Token Valid
    APIGW->>YouthAPI: transferFunds(request)
    YouthAPI->>CoreBank: Transfer Funds
    CoreBank-->>YouthAPI: Transfer Result
    YouthAPI->>Settings: Log Transfer (for audit)
    YouthAPI-->>APIGW: Transfer Response
    APIGW-->>WebUI: Transfer Result
    WebUI-->>Parent: Show Transfer Status

    Parent->>WebUI: Update Spending Limit
    WebUI->>APIGW: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit
    APIGW->>Auth: Validate OAuth2 Token
    Auth-->>APIGW: Token Valid
    APIGW->>YouthAPI: setSpendingLimit(request)
    YouthAPI->>Settings: Update Limit
    Settings-->>YouthAPI: Confirm Update
    YouthAPI-->>APIGW: Limit Response
    APIGW-->>WebUI: Limit Update Status
    WebUI-->>Parent: Show Confirmation

    Parent->>WebUI: View Transactions
    WebUI->>APIGW: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions
    APIGW->>Auth: Validate OAuth2 Token
    Auth-->>APIGW: Token Valid
    APIGW->>YouthAPI: getTransactions(params)
    YouthAPI->>TxnProxy: Fetch Transactions
    TxnProxy->>CoreBank: Get Transactions
    CoreBank-->>TxnProxy: Transaction Data
    TxnProxy-->>YouthAPI: Transaction List
    YouthAPI-->>APIGW: Transactions Response
    APIGW-->>WebUI: Transactions JSON
    WebUI-->>Parent: Render Transaction History
